<tr>
  <td align="left">
    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px">Hi {{candidateName}},</p>
    <p>Good news! Your profile caught someone's attention.</p>
    <p><strong>{{companyName}}</strong> viewed your profile for their <strong>{{jobTitle}}</strong> opening.</p>
    <p style="font-weight: 700; margin: 24px 0 12px 0;"><strong>What this means:</strong></p>
    <ul style="margin: 12px 0; padding-left: 28px;">
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;">Your skills match what they're looking for</li>
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;">They may reach out to you directly</li>
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;">You can apply proactively to stand out</li>
    </ul>
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td align="center" style="padding: 30px 0;">
    <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <a href="{{jobLink}}" target="_blank" class="button">View Job & Apply</a>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td align="left">
    <p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;">Keep your profile updated to attract more opportunities!</p>
  </td>
</tr>
 
